        "original_paragraph": {
            "Materials and Methods": "Biacore T100 instrument was used to analyze the binding kinetics of compounds 6 and 7 to VAP-1 protein. Recombinant purified VAP-1 was amine coupled to a CMS sensor chip. It was preconcentrated in 10 mM NaAcetate pH 4.4 with 10 μM CuCl2. The compounds were tested in 25 mM Tris pH 7.4, 150 mM NaCl, 10 μM CuCl2, 5% DMSO, and 0.005% Tween-20 at 25 °C. Compounds were tested in a 3-fold dilution series."
        },
